Description: Quick file previews for KDE Dolphin
 Preview images, PDFs, text and CSV/TSV/XLSX spreadsheets in a reusable
 window. Open Dzurkel Settings to configure the optional Space shortcut
 (requires Dolphin 26.04 or newer).
